internal-comms skill for my-website agent-services
====================================================

This skill is a rewritten adaptation of the "internal-comms" skill from
Anthropic's agent skills examples:

  https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/internal-comms

Original work Copyright (c) Anthropic PBC and contributors.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This adaptation:
  - keeps the communication-type routing (announcements, status and
    Progress/Plans/Problems updates, FAQ answers, general notices) and
    the format guidance of the original examples (short, facts first,
    one-to-three sentences per part, clarify audience/purpose/tone)
  - removes the original's host assumptions: mining Slack, email,
    calendars, and Google Drive for source material, company-size and
    channel conventions of the original author's workplace
  - rewrites source gathering against this platform's knowledge search
    and document enumeration tools, and adds this platform's citation
    and honest-gap constraints (an announced change that no source
    states must be flagged, never drafted as fact)

